# Optional. Published Google Sheets CSV URL, or any CSV endpoint.
# When unset, the app loads public/data/mastersheet.csv. When set (as in
# production), the app loads ONLY that URL on every visit — failure shows
# an error screen with a retry button, never stale data.
# VITE_DATA_URL=

# Optional. Published Keywords sheet tab as CSV. When set, the app loads the
# taxonomy live at startup (falling back to the baked generated module);
# the build also bakes this URL's content into the fallback.
# VITE_TAXONOMY_CSV_URL=

# Public origin used in Open Graph tags, sitemap.xml, and robots.txt.
# No trailing slash. GitHub Actions sets this automatically on deploy.
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME.github.io/conflict_timeline
